==Battleground==
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*1 [[Dogenstein]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Bun Bun]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Relic Bun-Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Tarsiriel]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
**1 [[Loris]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage isn't too difficult; the existence of multiple anti-Relic Mythics, on top of units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Paperboy Cat (Rare Cat)|Paperboy Cat]], make it entirely possible to massively cripple if not outright kill Relic Bun-Bun before their support can arrive. Stall out the initial One Horn and Li'l Bun Bun for cash, then use a combination of numerous Mythics (i.e. [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]], [[Ancient Egg: N000 (Special Cat)|Ape Lord Luza]], [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Awakened Doron]], [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]], [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]]) to build yourself an anti-Relic regime. Once Relic Bun-Bun is down for the count, the rest of his support is helpless to your advance.

